id: templates/observation-question-art
title: "Observation to Question to Art authoring guide"
kind: authoring-guide
status: draft
updated: 2026-08-16

purpose: >
  Point authors to complete executable templates without pretending a wrapper
  object is itself one of the advertised contracts.

templates:
  question_proposal: templates/question-proposal.v1.yawn
  art_brief: templates/art-brief.v1.yawn

rules:
  - "The Observation remains a distinct canonical record."
  - "The Question and Art Brief are attributed proposals."
  - "sourceSpanIndexes remains empty unless the open-question field has exact raw-source coordinates; V1 requires an empty array."
  - "The question remains semantic live text; image pixels never replace it."
  - "A candidate requires verified renderer output and remains non-canonical."
  - "Page composition and serialization are rebuildable Views."
  - "An Agent expression into an Arena is a Projection; a layout is not."

decision_boundary:
  question_acceptance: separate_authenticated_event
  render_grant: exact_brief_and_workflow_grant
  candidate_acceptance: separate_authenticated_event
  publication: separate_authenticated_event
  yawn_promotion: separate_authenticated_event

links:
  - schemas/question-proposal.v1.schema.json
  - schemas/art-brief.v1.schema.json
  - templates/question-proposal.v1.yawn
  - templates/art-brief.v1.yawn
  - interface/local-observation-art-v0.1.yawn
